  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>since, no external force is acting on the system, we can apply conservation of linear momentum.</p><p>Speed of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> trolley <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>36</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi></math> be the initial velocity of trolley, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></math> be the absolute velocity of the boy after the beginning of journey of the boy, their relative velocity is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>.</p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>v</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>v</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, applying law of conservation of momentum,</p><p>Momentum before the boy begins tu run<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo></math> Momentum after the beginning of boy&#39;s running</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mn>220</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><msup><mi>v</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>v</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2200</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>220</mn><msup><mi>v</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>220</mn><msup><mi>v</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2280</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>v</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2280</mn><mn>220</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
